Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.20,0:16:37.52,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,SKILL: TATAPAN TAJAM, DROP: ???
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.52,0:17:19.34,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,PELEPASAN SEMANGAT TEMPUR\NSEMANGAT TEMPUR: 100%
